1
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:14,580
I was born in a small village.

2
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:21,280
When I was young, foreign soldiers took over my village.

3
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:26,560
I was torn from the adults and forced to learn their language.

4
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:30,880
With every shift in the war, the rulers changed,

5
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:34,060
and each time, I was made to speak a different tongue.

6
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:38,920
As the language changed, so did I.

7
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:44,200
My personality, my thinking, my sense of right and wrong.

8
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:48,820
Language kills.

9
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:53,620
That country was conquered by foreign tongues again and again.

10
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:56,820
Because of that, while still a child,

11
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,700
I lost the foundation of my mother tongue.

12
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:04,300
Country, family, face — every proof of who he was, taken from him.

13
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:08,320
All that was left was a skull.

14
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:12,070


15
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:50,100
When people unite under a single will,

16
00:01:50,190 --> 00:01:53,610
they become a far greater force.

17
00:01:53,610 --> 00:01:59,450
That single will is the ruler.

18
00:01:59,450 --> 00:02:04,530
Rulers use language to unite their people.

19
00:02:04,530 --> 00:02:08,570
The world becomes one.

20
00:02:08,570 --> 00:02:10,530
And I've found the key to making that happen.

21
00:02:10,530 --> 00:02:15,670
No need to change race, ethnicity, borders, or faces.

22
00:02:15,670 --> 00:02:19,690
People will be connected through a new form of communication.

23
00:02:19,690 --> 00:02:23,230
The world The Boss envisioned will finally be within reach.

24
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:23,010
America — the land of the free.

25
00:03:23,230 --> 00:03:25,470
A nation of immigrants.

26
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:29,990
Its people never truly melded — they live divided by race.

27
00:03:29,990 --> 00:03:35,030
What the Major sought there was information, language,

28
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:38,870
a system to control the unconscious mind.

29
00:03:38,870 --> 00:03:44,140
What parasitizes the world is not an insect.

30
00:03:44,140 --> 00:03:45,840
It's language.

31
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:50,100
Language is what sustains the world, sustains civilization.

32
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:51,980
Not people. Not nations.

33
00:03:51,980 --> 00:03:56,640
By killing language, I will free the world from domination.

34
00:03:56,640 --> 00:04:06,170
I will save the world — by eradicating English.

35
00:04:06,170 --> 00:04:11,830
Without English as a common tongue, the world will fracture.

36
00:04:11,830 --> 00:04:21,170
And in that fracture, the world will be free.

37
00:05:06,790 --> 00:05:12,720


38
00:05:33,350 --> 00:05:35,830
Les Enfants Terribles.

39
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,780
That's what Zero called them.
